# Support conversations

The life buoy icon, top right, no longer opens the form directly and now shows [all your past support threads](/support_tickets), with the full discussion (your messages and my replies).

The [support request form](/support_tickets/new) (now available from the list) has been simplified. You can now also reply in the app. Replying by email (above the line) is of course still supported, like any other email conversation.

Centralizing your support requests in the app helps me treat them more efficiently, and to see overall what could be improved or better explained in [the handbook](/handbook).
